  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Livelihoods in Horticulture Value Chains</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to unlock the potential of Rwanda&apos;s horticultural value chains to ensure the supply of safe and high -quality products to local, regional and international markets. The project will reach 21,000 beneficiaries, (of which 55% will be women), who are active along all horticulture value chains in four target districts of Rwanda which are Kamonyi, Rulindo, Nyagatare and Nyamagabe.</narrative>
  </description>
